  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When used as an instrumental, allies within the area gain a +3 morale bonus to saving throws against effects that would give them any disorientation condition (and to the DC to affect them with such effects), increasing by 1 per 5 ranks in this package’s associated skill.</p>\n<p>Additionally, affected allies increase the bonus from being taught (new skill use) by 1 and unlock skill leverage with one skill you have unlocked (chosen when you begin or maintain the instrumental).</p>\n<p>When used as an inspiring lyric, the target gains 1 temporary use of skill leverage and unlocks skill leverage with all the skills you have unlocked. A single creature may only benefit from this lyric once every day. Using the skill leverage counts as expending the lyric (if the lyric could not be expended, they cannot gain the benefits of this lyric). This does not count as a creature regaining skill leverage for the purposes of abilities that rely on it.</p>\n<p>You may spend 1 use of skill leverage when using this lyric to grant the target 1 use of skill leverage, regardless of whether or not they have already benefited from this lyric.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
